w21-plan-changing-ask
---------------------

This directory is a clean-room Python 3 standard-library method sketch. It is
original work for this repository and contains no third-party code, data or
weights.

Paper (method idea credited)
----------------------------
Yuhan Tang, Ke Fan, Xinkai Zou, Baichuan Mo, Kangxin Cui, Ao Qu, Ou Zheng,
Jiangbo Yu, Haris N. Koutsopoulos, Jinhua Zhao and Yuan Zhou.
"From Questions to Decisions: Benchmarking How LLM Agents Acquire
Decision-Relevant Information from Human Beings". arXiv:2611.13015, v1,
submitted 9 Nov 2026. Ask2Decide is the benchmark's name in the abstract.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.13015
Licence: arXiv non-exclusive distribution licence,
http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/ (a paper licence, not a
software grant). The abstract says: "This is ongoing work and will be
updated." Code: UNVERIFIED; no code link was found on the abs page and none
is used.

Method only: the idea of an operator who holds facts missing from the
agent's request, some of which change the plan and some of which are
similarly worded but do not. No text, figures, tables, prompts or data from
the paper are copied into the code; the PDF was not read; the human study
and the solvers were not re-run. The paper's figures appear only in
paper_evidence.json, quoted and marked UNVERIFIED.
